 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Board of width columns and height rows; rectangles are inclusive cell boxes given by top-left (x1,y1) and bottom-right (x2,y2) with x1<=x2, y1<=y2 inside the board. addRectangle returns the next positive id starting at 1 (ids never reused) and places it on top. getTopRectangle(x,y) returns the id of the topmost active rectangle covering the cell, or -1 if none.",
